AUTOMATION :

1. DESKTOP APPLICATONS
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
| Library          | Best for                        | Notes                                             |
| ---------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
| **PyAutoGUI**    | Mouse/keyboard automation       | Easy; works by interacting with the screen        |
| **pywinauto**    | Windows desktop apps            | Excellent for native Windows apps                 |
| **PyWinAuto**    | Windows UI automation           | Useful for controls, windows, buttons, dialogs    |
| **pynput**       | Keyboard/mouse control          | Lightweight input automation                      |
| **Appium**       | Mobile/desktop-style automation | Useful for certain app ecosystems                 |
| **WinAppDriver** | Windows UI automation           | Older ecosystem; less attractive for new projects |
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


